{"data":[{"author_id":"2869390354","created_at":"2026-10-11T01:33:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109094987044618296"],"id":"2109094987044618296","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":282,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Neuralink：把芯片放进大脑\n\n2016 年，马斯克参与创办脑机接口公司 Neuralink，第二年对外公开。他的理由是，人类要跟上 AI，就得提高大脑和机器之间的\"带宽\"。2024 年 1 月，Neuralink 第一次给人类患者植入设备。四肢瘫痪的诺兰·阿博后来能用意念控制电脑，下国际象棋、打游戏。","url":"https://x.com/jhdxhl/status/2109094987044618296"},{"author_id":"1749597659902713856","created_at":"2026-10-10T22:27:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109048141710504173"],"id":"2109048141710504173","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":214,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"魏茨曼科学研究所团队提出的Brain-IT，能根据受试者观看图像时的fMRI信号，重建画面的内容、构图和颜色。解码一名新受试者大约只需一小时扫描，研究已入选ICLR。团队还在探索把同类方法延伸到声音，并评估视频重建的可行性。","url":"https://x.com/bytelee_trade/status/2109048141710504173"},{"author_id":"1545012235092692999","created_at":"2026-10-10T23:25:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109062679822545237"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/PhyrexNi/statu…","end":184,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/PhyrexNi/status/2108973332146368918","start":161,"url":"https://t.co/UfPmDISaw0"}]},"id":"2109062679822545237","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":415,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"针对你目前24小时量化监控、多设备远程眼脑协同、以及想榨干 Mac Studio 本地 AI 算力的诉求，这里为你梳理了一份“Mac Studio AI 服务器搞机清爽指南”。既然你中午刚和几位圈内大佬聊完，下面这些方案正好可以帮你把学到的小技巧直接“全自动化”落地。\n\n🚀 既然环境折腾好了，这 4 类任务最适合 24 https://t.co/UfPmDISaw0","url":"https://x.com/Alpha_Events50/status/2109062679822545237"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109058832819458048","3_2109088375173210112","3_2109088460640587776","3_2109088614923776000"]},"author_id":"2039980490032091136","created_at":"2026-10-11T01:13:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109089872086724646"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/e8VgoLZMxV